    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23269" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιτῠμ-ών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όνος</span>,
